      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      510.31,
      276.12,
      531.92
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      533.35,
      286.44,
      623.84
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land called Delgahawatta alias Millagahawatta in total extent of about 0.3284 hectare depicted as Lot No. 272 in the Cadastral Map No. 511211 prepared by the Superintendent of Surveys\u2014Gampaha, situated in the village called Kimbulapitiya in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Katana in Gampaha District of the Western province and morefully described as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      629.84,
      286.41,
      715.76
    ],
    "text": "Schedule Lot No. 272 Name of the land: Delgahawatta alias Millagahawatta; Description: Home Garden, 38 coconut trees of about 15\u201425 years old; Claimant: N. W. Kamala Ranjanee, No. 73, \u201cRanga\u201d Thaladoowa Road, Negambo; Extent: 0.3284 Hectare",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      349.76,
      541.32,
      605.84
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat, Katana on 08th day of November 2017 at 09.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 01st day of November, 2017 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. K. G. H .H. R. KIRIELLA, Divisional Secretary, Divisional Secretaray\u2019s Division, Katana. Divisional Secretariat, Katana, 17th August, 2017. 08-1124",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961
